features are gated by ECDSA-validated license keys (see `Pro.Licensing`).
Without a valid license, Pro endpoints answer HTTP 402: the predictive
dialer, analytics and call analytics, agent assist, CSAT surveys,
advanced typification with its AI suggestion, routing skills and
realtime profiles; the Pro event store records nothing. Once a license
has expired and its grace period has passed, the dialer, analytics,
call analytics, agent assist, CSAT, event store and typification
modules switch off, while routing, realtime, multi-tenancy and
clustering keep working. Multi-tenancy and clustering are not
license-gated.

